   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving opinions with dass",
     "texto": [
      "With **ich glaube** (I believe), **ich finde** (I think) or **ich denke** (I think), **dass** is used: **Ich glaube, dass es teuer ist** (I believe it's expensive). The conjugated verb goes at the end: **ist**.",
      "Another way to give an opinion: **Wie findest du …?** (what do you think of…?): **Wie findest du den Film?** (what do you think of the film?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Difference between dass and das",
     "texto": [
      "**Dass** introduces what someone thinks, says or knows; **weil** introduces a reason. Example: **Ich glaube, dass der Bus spät kommt, weil es viel Verkehr gibt** (I believe the bus is coming late because there's a lot of traffic).",
      "**Dass** is written with **ss** and **das** can be an article or a pronoun: **das Wetter** (the weather), **Ich weiß das** (I know that). The pronunciation is the same."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
